lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThere are 30 different types of tea in a tea house. The owner tells the customers that most are green tea, a small part are white tea and black tea. After tasting, the customer finds that only 2 types are black tea.\n\n[Question]\nPlease ask the customer to guess how many types are green tea after tasting?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After tasting, the customer guesses there are 20 types of green tea.\nB. After tasting, the customer guesses there are 10 types of green tea.\nC. After tasting, the customer guesses there are 28 types of green tea.\nD. After tasting, the customer guesses there are 26 types of green tea.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069975375296375,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a6bc2ddb05a7fe2e057","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452075571,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"fa994deadfb74dac8622e769ad328a56"}